  },
  "notes": "The public-domain Met daguerreotype shows both Mamluk minaret crowns, their different window groups and carved stages. The Egyptian monuments service, Museum With No Frontiers and Archnet identify the projecting portal, arcades, covered prayer hall and surviving central dome. Egyptian government records confirm the 2023 restoration."
